{
  "name": "Enrich tens of thousands of rows with a LeadMagic bulk job",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Large-list enrichment with a bulk job\n\n### How it works\n1. Reads every row from a Google Sheet.\n2. Submits them as one asynchronous LeadMagic bulk job (up to 500,000 rows).\n3. Checks the job every 2 minutes until it finishes.\n4. Pulls the results and appends one row per input to a results sheet.\n\n### Setup\n1. Source sheet columns must match the product's inputs: `first_name`, `last_name`, `domain` for Find Work Email.\n2. Paste the source and results sheet URLs.\n3. Select your LeadMagic and Google Sheets credentials.\n\n### Customization\nChange **Product** in **Submit bulk job** to validate emails, find mobiles, or enrich profiles instead. For very large jobs, set a Callback URL to an n8n Webhook instead of polling.\n\nRequires the [LeadMagic community node](https://github.com/LeadMagic/leadmagic-n8n#install) (`n8n-nodes-leadmagic`). Tested with n8n 2.47 and n8n-nodes-leadmagic 1.8.0.",
        "height": 660,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "b4322342-4352-59b9-b8eb-75b452e7d5a9",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "5b555faf-fd65-51f0-852d-95ca2717db9b",
      "name": "Run manually",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "url"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gid=0",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "Sheet1"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "748abb7c-a5e4-5987-8632-3e1c6932f450",
      "name": "Read rows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.7,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "bulkJob",
        "operation": "submitBulkJob",
        "product": "email_finder",
        "rowsFrom": "items",
        "rowFields": "first_name, last_name, domain",
        "bulkOptions": {
          "idempotencyKey": "={{ $execution.id }}",
          "fileName": "n8n bulk email finder"
        }
      },
      "id": "66895d47-2102-5b1e-b370-119d4f9938d6",
      "name": "Submit bulk job",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-leadmagic.leadMagic",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 2,
        "unit": "minutes"
      },
      "id": "c962a388-1c99-5fa1-841d-e1bc8a2a71c1",
      "name": "Wait 2 minutes",
